Z||000004||Monkeyman||09-26-2001||05:43 AM||||I had a non dual band StarTac first (about a year ago).  I had problem after problem with it so I traded up to a Nokia flip phone (forget which model and I'm not about to dig through my wifes purse to find the phone--I don't have 'STUPID' written on my forehead!) which I absolutely loved.  I decided that I wanted to upgrade to digital service (actually it's an analog system with a digital overlay around here) so I had to upgrade phones once again.  I'm a gadget junkie and wanted to stick with Nokia so I bought the 7160.  I noticed the other day that there were some graphics built into the phone as well as the ringtones.  Any idea how I could program other graphics into the phone?  A fastback GT would be the ultimate!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
