Z||000010||stimpy||09-26-2001||07:16 PM||||As far as the logos go, I have no idea. My phone (5165) doesn't support that. But with the ringer tones, I found that a LOT of the links don't work. Anything on the "Latest Additions" pages is a safe bet that they will work. Just click on the box that says "send" then enter your ph# with area code, click the drop down box to select your carrier then your good to go. If you still have problems, there might besomething wrong with the setup of either your service or your phone. Good luck. ||||reg||1
